cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cint, cite the version you used. https://integerc.dev/cite/ also gives citations for each specification edition and paper."
type: software
title: cint
abstract: "cint is an integer-only, C-family language. Every plain operator is checked, cintc emits standard C17, and every conforming build gives the same output and fault record."
authors:
